CM_ BO_ 640 "0x280. Compiled from DBC + 'more infos' notes + Teensy sender. RPM scaling matches Teensy (raw = rpm*4). Time slice: 30ms.";
CM_ BO_ 649 "0x289. Motor_2 mapped from VW PQ Motor_2 layout; replaces original EngineTemp mapping. Time slice: 30ms.";
CM_ BO_ 664 "0x298. Several signals marked 'Turbo? Unsure' in notes; Speed_raw scaling unknown. Time slice: 30ms.";
CM_ BO_ 680 "0x2A8. Using legacy 15-bit wheel-speed variant.";
CM_ BO_ 416 "0x1A0. Uses Bremse_1 BR1 mapping with ASR/MSR/ABS status bits, 15-bit vehicle speed, torque fields, and message counter/status bits 56..63.";
CM_ BO_ 1185 "0x4A1. Compiled from DBC notes list. BrakeNormal_or_Offset depends on multiplex code (bits 30-31).";
CM_ BO_ 1248 "0x4E0. Uses byte0 status/lamp interpretation on bits 0..7 plus MO5 lamp/consumption layout on bits 9..31. Time slice: 30ms.";
CM_ BO_ 1296 "0x510. VehicleSpeed scaling/offset from notes list appears unusual; treat as working hypothesis.";
CM_ BO_ 1312 "0x520. AmbientTemp and OilPressure from notes/DBC list. OilPressure offset not specified in notes; assumed 0.";
CM_ BO_ 1088 "0x440. PRND mapping from notes: P=128, R=119, N=96, D=81, M=225.";
CM_ BO_ 192 "0x00C0. RB Lenkwinkel_1 layout: DLC=2, angle on bits 5..14 (factor 2.5, offset -720) plus Vorzeichen/LWS status/check bits.";
CM_ BO_ 1272 "0x4F8. Message observed/listed but signals unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 1376 "0x560. Message observed/listed but signals unknown.";
CM_ BO_ 1952 "0x7A0. Message observed/listed but signals unknown. Time slice: 30ms. Standard payload: 85 0C 00 03 00 00 FF 02.";
VAL_ 1088 PRND_Pos 128 "P" 119 "R" 96 "N" 81 "D" 225 "M";
